**Charts:**
**1. ska-tmc-integration 0.22.5 - 0.22.6:*

 **1.1 ska-tmc-mid - 0.22.5 - 0.22.6:
        a. Updated dish leaf node version to  0.17.6 to resolve SKB-467
        b. Track command will not be invoked from Dish leaf node if  pointingState of Dish is TRACK/SLEW